Command[\n    beforeskip=-10pt plus -2pt minus -1pt,\n    afterskip=1sp plus -1sp minus 1sp,\n    font=\\normalfont\\itshape]{paragraph}\n  \\RedeclareSectionCommand[\n    beforeskip=-10pt plus -2pt minus -1pt,\n    afterskip=1sp plus -1sp minus 1sp,\n    font=\\normalfont\\scshape,\n    indent=0pt]{subparagraph}\n...\nclassoption\noption for document class, e.g. oneside; repeat for multiple options:\n---\nclassoption:\n- twocolumn\n- landscape\n...\ndocumentclass\ndocument class: usually one of the standard classes, article, book, and report; the KOMA-Script equivalents, scrartcl, scrbook, and scrreprt, which default to smaller margins; or memoir \ngeometry\noption for geometry package, e.g. margin=1in; repeat for multiple options:\n---\ngeometry:\n- top=30mm\n- left=20mm\n- heightrounded\n...\nhyperrefoptions\noption for hyperref package, e.g. linktoc=all; ","body_utf8_bytes":1350,"content_codepoints":1341,"content_utf8_bytes":1341,"corpus_sha256":"a2507268ef20cc0b9dc55b351b44e7973961e352f17f86dbb3b2b01dc3127b2d","deferred_link_ids":[],"display_codepoints":1429,"display_sha256":"54046aa18450aa740f3ce96ceac79289b99ce6fab24caedc0cacb9e69af568e2","display_text":"[p21403 2.14.0.3 offset=73722]\nVariables for LaTeX\nPandoc uses these variables when [n2l518] creating a PDF with a LaTeX engine.\nLayout\nblock-headings\nmake \\paragraph and \\subparagraph (fourth- and fifth-level headings, or fifth- and sixth-level with book classes) free-standing rather than run-in; requires further formatting to distinguish from \\subsubsection (third- or fourth-level headings). Instead of using this option, KOMA-Script can adjust headings more extensively:\n---\ndocumentclass: scrartcl\nheader-includes: |\n  \\RedeclareSectionCommand[\n    beforeskip=-10pt plus -2pt minus -1pt,\n    afterskip=1sp plus -1sp minus 1sp,\n    font=\\normalfont\\itshape]{paragraph}\n  \\RedeclareSectionCommand[\n    beforeskip=-10pt plus -2pt minus -1pt,\n    afterskip=1sp plus -1sp minus 1sp,\n    font=\\normalfont\\scshape,\n    indent=0pt]{subparagraph}\n...\nclassoption\noption for document class, e.g. oneside; repeat for multiple options:\n---\nclassoption:\n- twocolumn\n- landscape\n...\ndocumentclass\ndocument class: usually one of the standard classes, article, book, and report; the KOMA-Script equivalents, scrartcl, scrbook, and scrreprt, which default to smaller margins; or memoir \ngeometry\noption for geometry package, e.g. margin=1in; repeat for multiple options:\n---\ngeometry:\n- top=30mm\n- left=20mm\n- heightrounded\n...\nhyperrefoptions\noption for hyperref package, e.g. linktoc=all; \n[next] 다음 구간 | [again] 재열람 | [back] 직전 열람(있으면)\n","display_utf8_bytes":1457,"doc_id":"p21403","document_navigation_codepoints":9,"document_navigation_intervals":[[73775,73784]],"document_navigation_utf8_bytes":9,"document_version":"2.14.0.3","fragment":"variables-for-latex","fragment_basis":"nearest_preceding_fixed_anchor","http_request_performed":false,"navigation_classification_supplied":true,"navigation_codepoints":79,"navigation_text":"[p21403 2.14.0.3 offset=73722]\n\n[next] 다음 구간 | [again] 재열람 | [back] 직전 열람(있으면)\n","navigation_utf8_bytes":107,"next_offset":75072,"offset_end":75072,"offset_start":73722,"partial_link_ids":[],"render_reserve_codepoints":150,"requested_document_url":"https://pandoc.org/MANUAL.html","source_sha":"001be3d1f162f8cb64b420cf9457fdaf518e775455e10c477a6632d988a58cb8","source_slice_codepoints":1350,"source_slice_utf8_bytes":1350,"total_navigation_codepoints":88,"total_navigation_utf8_bytes":116,"transport":"offline_fixed_document_viewer","visible_link_ids":["n2l518"]}}
{"answer":{"citations":[{"doc_id":"p21403","quote":"pandoc test.txt -o test.pdf"},{"doc_id":"p21403","quote":"requires that a LaTeX engine be installed"},{"doc_id":"p21403","quote":"option for geometry package, e.g. margin=1in; repeat for multiple options:"},{"doc_id":"p21403","quote":"the KOMA-Script equivalents, scrartcl, scrbook, and scrreprt, which default to smaller margins"}],"disposition":"부분 확인","exceptions":"기본 PDF 경로에는 LaTeX 엔진 설치가 필요하며 문서 클래스에 따라 기본 여백이 달라질 수 있다. 표를 없앤 대조와 그림을 교체한 대조는 표시된 문서에 나오지 않았으므로 필요한 추가 조건, 문제를 일으키는 조합, 해결 설정을 특정할 근거가 없다.","operation":"Pandoc 2.14.0.3에서 출력 확장자를 .pdf로 지정하는 PDF 생성 방법과 기본 LaTeX 엔진 경로를 확인했다. LaTeX PDF에는 documentclass 및 geometry 변수를 적용할 수 있고, geometry에 margin=1in 같은 여백 옵션을 전달하는 예가 있다. 중간 LaTeX 출력은 생성 문제를 점검하는 출발점이 될 수 있다.","preservation":"여백 설정 기능은 확인했으나, 그 설정만으로 다음 페이지로 떠오른 그림 뒤의 텍스트와 표가 하단 여백 안에서 계속 흐른다는 사실은 확인되지 않았다. 이 세 번의 열람으로는 요청된 배치 성질의 보존 여부를 판정할 수 없다."},"at_utc":"2026-11-24T05:15:48.766933+00:00","command_wall_seconds":0.12926957699994546,"elapsed_is_wall_not_human_active_time":true,"elapsed_since_exposure_seconds":11.327815,"event":"answer","event_sha256":"9813ca7e5c117e5366b4c43fdd94860c495ef8d9258a11fba57c052177cd7139","exposure_event_sha256":"8341530c50aae5810a5cca0a553d0601868a922523956255d22aec6b752b21b8","previous_event_sha256":"8341530c50aae5810a5cca0a553d0601868a922523956255d22aec6b752b21b8","recorded_before_next_open":true,"seq":10,"session":"r07","step":3}
